    {
      "id": "wallpaper-britain-britain_deck_po2",
      "name": "英国：物资短缺",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/britain_supply_shortage.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Britain",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/britain_deck_po2.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "supply_shortage",
      "description": "Ultra 情报行动使盟军能够解密轴心国的高层通信，掌握其向北非运输物资的时间与路线。盟军据此拦截并摧毁运输船队，使非洲军团缺乏燃料、装备和补给，成为北非战役取胜的关键因素之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-britain-t_loading_britain_05",
      "name": "英国：皇家西肯特郡团",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/britain_royal_west_kents.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Britain",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/t_loading_britain_05.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "royal_west_kents",
      "description": "女王直属皇家西肯特步兵团是一支驻扎于肯特郡的英军步兵团。战争爆发时，它隶属位于法国的英国远征军，在敦刻尔克撤离行动中遭受了重创。1943 年突尼斯战役末期，再次损伤严重。1944 年，该团在意大利卡西诺山等地与德国部队作战。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-britain-t_loading_britain_07",
      "name": "英国：喷火 Mk Ia",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/britain_spitfire_mk_ia.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Britain",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/t_loading_britain_07.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "spitfire_mk_ia",
      "description": "著名的超级马林喷火战斗机是英国及盟军在第二次世界大战期间及战后使用的一款英国战斗机。该机非常灵活，以牺牲航程换取速度和机动性。因此，这款飞机不适合用于进攻作战，不过它在防御作战中表现出色，尤是在不列颠之役期间。喷火式战斗机还衍生出了许多改型，是产量最多的英国飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-britain-t_loading_britain_c",
      "name": "英国：护航船队",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/britain_escort_group.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Britain",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Britain/t_loading_britain_c.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "escort_group",
      "description": "二战期间，皇家海军以驱逐舰和护卫舰护送商船，利用雷达、声纳及目视观察发现德国 U 型潜艇，再以深水炸弹、火炮和鱼雷攻击。不断改进的护航战术、通信和反潜武器，有效降低了商船损失。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-germany-german_campaign",
      "name": "德国：虎式坦克 H 型",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/german_tiger_ih.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Germany",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/german_campaign.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "tiger_ih",
      "description": "虎 I 坦克 H 型（Tiger I-H）是二战德国重型坦克，搭载 5 名乘员，装备 88 毫米 KwK 36 坦克炮。它拥有出色的战斗能力，但制造和维护成本高昂，仅生产了 1,347 辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-germany-t_loading_germany_05",
      "name": "德国：Bf 109 E",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/germany_me_bf_109_e.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Germany",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/t_loading_germany_05.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "me_bf_109_e",
      "description": "梅塞施密特 Bf 109 是纳粹德国空军在二战期间主要使用的战斗机。Bf 109 最初在西班牙内战（1939）期间服役，直到二战结束时，德国和其轴心国盟友仍在使用这种机型。它是当时最为先进的一种战斗机，在整个二战期间的空中歼敌数超过其他任何一种飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-germany-t_loading_germany_07",
      "name": "德国：来自深处",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/germany_from_the_deep.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Germany",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/t_loading_germany_07.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "from_the_deep",
      "description": "德国 U 型潜艇是二战大西洋战场的主力。战争初期，潜艇有时会先警告船员弃船，再用甲板炮击沉商船；随着盟军商船武装化，攻击逐渐不再预警。整场战争中，德国 U 型潜艇击沉了约 5,000 艘盟军船只。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-germany-t_loading_germany_c",
      "name": "德国：步兵",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/germany_infantry.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Germany",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Germany/t_loading_germany_c.png"
      ],
      "cardType": "infantry",
      "description": "战斗中的德军步兵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-japan-japan_campaign_po2",
      "name": "日本：秋田联队",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Japan/japan_akita_regiment.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Japan",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Japan/japan_campaign_po2.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "akita_regiment",
      "description": "步兵第 17 联队（秋田）所效力的日本帝国陆军步兵第 2 师团（勇兵团）曾参与过诺门罕战役、爪哇战役、瓜达尔卡纳尔岛战役以及缅甸中部战役。当时，秋田县的首府秋田市建立了数支联队，这些联队后来在日本帝国陆军中曾经效命于多支师团。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-japan-t_loading_Japan_05",
      "name": "日本：IJN 信浓号",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Japan/Japan_ijn_shinano.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Japan",
      "previousFiles": [
        "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Japan/t_loading_Japan_05.png"
      ],
      "cardId": "ijn_shinano",
      "description": "信浓号原计划作为第三艘大和级战列舰，建造中改装为航空母舰，满载排水量约 72,000 吨，是当时最大的航母。它于 1944 年 11 月首航，同月 29 日被美军潜艇射水鱼号击沉，未能发挥预期战力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-japan-t_loading_Japan_06",
      "name": "日本：拂晓行动",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Japan/Japan_dawn_operations.png",
