      "cardId": "petlyakov_pe2",
      "description": "佩特利亚科夫 PE-2 是二战苏联的轻型轰炸机，速度快、机动性高，除对地攻击外，也执行侦察和夜间战斗等任务。它在欧洲及满洲战场服役，二战期间共生产 11,427 架。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallpaper-soviet-t_loading_soviet_a",
      "name": "苏联：别-4",
      "file": "/assets/tablecloths/wallpaper/Soviet/soviet_beriev_be4.png",
      "type": "wallpaper",
      "nation": "Soviet",
      "previousFiles": [
